    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Israeli
    corporate law does not provide for shareholder action by written consent for public companies, thereby requiring all shareholder
    actions to be taken at a general meeting of shareholders.</span></td></tr>
