<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company evaluated the put right under ASC 815-40 and determined it should be accounted for as a derivative liability measured at fair
value (Level 2), with changes recognized in the statement of operations. The Put right is measured under level 2 of the Fair Value hierarchy.
The Company analyzed the terms of the freestanding put right and concluded that it has an immaterial value as of December 31, 2025.</span></p>

