                                            January 5, 2026, and February 12, 2026, the Company repurchased <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares_pid_c20260105__20260105__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zAZJbq44fFvl" title="Number of repurchase, shares"><span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares_pid_c20260212__20260212__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zLYZQlhalar3" title="Number of repurchase, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" contextRef="From2026-01-052026-01-05_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002062" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" contextRef="From2026-02-122026-02-12_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002064" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,831,033</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> of its ordinary
