                                            amounted to $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue_c20260105__20260105__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zopkmyJL6wti" title="Number of repurchase, value"><span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue_c20260212__20260212__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_z6aUAKp4scye" title="Number of repurchase, value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue" contextRef="From2026-01-052026-01-05_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002066" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue" contextRef="From2026-02-122026-02-12_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002068" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">862,957</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>. In addition, the Company incurred $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--BrokerageCommissionsRevenue_pid_c20260105__20260105__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_z5wednL0UNvg" title="Brokerage commissions"><span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--BrokerageCommissionsRevenue_pid_c20260212__20260212__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zJqnV8lZt31i" title="Brokerage commissions"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BrokerageCommissionsRevenue" contextRef="From2026-01-052026-01-05_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002070" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BrokerageCommissionsRevenue" contextRef="From2026-02-122026-02-12_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002072" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USD">18,310</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> of brokerage commissions
                                            directly attributable to the share repurchases.</span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 81.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

